//// set: ea-e2 — 对照：不带 Evaluate 的结构参数数组（维、if 条件、引用代入）；标量 Evaluate 的函数绑定、依赖 Evaluate = false
//// model: E20
model E20
parameter Integer k[2] = {1, 2};
Real y[k[2]];
end E20;
//// model: E21
model E21
parameter Real a[2] = {1, 2};
parameter Real n = a[1] annotation(Evaluate = true);
end E21;
//// model: E22
model E22
parameter Integer k[2] = {1, 2};
Real y[k[2]];
Real z = k[1] * time;
end E22;
//// model: E23
model E23
parameter Boolean b[2] = {true, false};
Real y;
equation
if b[1] then
y = 1;
else
y = 2;
end if;
end E23;
//// model: E50
function f
input Real u;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 2 * u;
end f;
model E50
parameter Real p = f(3) annotation(Evaluate = true);
end E50;
//// model: E51
model E51
parameter Real p = 2 annotation(Evaluate = false);
parameter Real n = p annotation(Evaluate = true);
end E51;
